1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,460
See this little arrow

2
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:02,530
on your fuel gauge?

3
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:04,467
Most drivers never notice it.

4
00:00:04,487 --> 00:00:05,907
You pull into a gas station

5
00:00:05,907 --> 00:00:07,139
in a rental car,

6
00:00:07,159 --> 00:00:08,759
and park on the wrong side.

7
00:00:08,779 --> 00:00:10,284
The hose won't reach.

8
00:00:10,304 --> 00:00:11,564
That arrow was trying

9
00:00:11,564 --> 00:00:12,146
to help you.

10
00:00:12,166 --> 00:00:13,236
In most cars, it points

11
00:00:13,236 --> 00:00:14,346
to the side

12
00:00:14,346 --> 00:00:15,665
your fuel door is on.

13
00:00:15,685 --> 00:00:16,435
Arrow left,

14
00:00:16,435 --> 00:00:17,636
door on the left.

15
00:00:17,656 --> 00:00:18,416
Arrow right,

16
00:00:18,416 --> 00:00:19,582
door on the right.

17
00:00:19,602 --> 00:00:21,314
No more guessing at the pump.

18
00:00:21,334 --> 00:00:22,234
Follow for more

19
00:00:22,234 --> 00:00:23,321
hidden designs.
